;; Genes metformin interacts with that are also associated with type 2 diabetes
;; metformin anchors: CHEBI:6801 expansion (~120 ids) -> membership relation `met`
;; T2D anchors: MONDO:0005148 expansion (9 ids) -> inlined literals
;; interaction side covers the interacts_with predicate family, both edge directions
;; drug-side gene ids and T2D-associated gene ids joined on the kg2_norm canonical key

table (edge str str str)
table (node str str str)
table (kg2_norm str str)
table (met str)
table (result str str)

